  "interpretation": [
    "The historical 2016 path derives horizontal beam from supplied STR\u00c5NG DNI before averaging. Changed solar geometry therefore changes DHI and building response there; the later cases retain supplied DNI and horizontal beam means.",
    "Daylight-classification changes concern geometric interval horizon decisions. Exported GHI/DNI remain identical in these smooth fixtures, whose independent NOAA-style input profile includes a horizon margin.",
    "These fixtures verify parsing, recovery, interval semantics, preservation of supplied components and clean engine consumption. They are deterministic engineering inputs, not independently observed weather or a climate sample.",
